<overview>
<p>New technology and creative tactical thinking have long featured in FWLM infantry deployment, with varied unit types and specialized formations treated as the norm rather than the exception. Towing crew-served Ultra autocannon/10, these platoons bring heavy rapid-fire capability to the field gun role, doubling their rate of fire when the tactical situation demands it at the cost of increased mechanical stress on the weapon.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on production date of ultra-class autocannon
</notes>

